##

00:00:00.171 --> 00:00:04.176 position:61% line:91%
There are times on this channel when
I know exactly what I'm gonna be doing.

00:00:04.176 --> 00:00:06.466 line:85%
This is not one of those times!

00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:09.106 line:91%
The production crew just said
that I should meet here...

00:00:09.106 --> 00:00:12.000 line:91%
...on a farm in Ayrshire?
<c.yellow>Spot on, yes.</c>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.702 line:91%
And meet Cammy Wilson from
The Sheep Game.

00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:18.362 position:59% line:91%
And I don't know what's happening now!
What's gonna happen?

00:00:18.362 --> 00:00:21.300 position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>Well Tom, I've got a very exciting day
planned for you today.</c>

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.788 line:91%
<c.yellow>We're gonna try our hand
at some sheep herding.</c>

00:00:23.788 --> 00:00:25.797 line:85%
Right, okay.

00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:30.640 line:91%
<c.yellow>Got a nice little
tame group for you today.</c>

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.558 line:91%
<i>(laughs)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Okay, thank you.</c>
<c.yellow>I say tame.</c>

00:00:32.558 --> 00:00:34.782 line:91%
<c.yellow>I don't know how this is gonna go.</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:36.580 line:85%
I never know how this is gonna go!

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.313 line:91%
<c.yellow>So we're gonna try
working with a sheep dog.</c>

00:00:39.313 --> 00:00:41.308 line:91%
<c.yellow>We're gonna try and see
how your whistling is.</c>

00:00:41.308 --> 00:00:44.070 position:61% line:85%
<c.yellow>We have a specific sheep dog whistle...</c>

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.134 line:91%
Right, okay.
<c.yellow>...for you to try.</c>

00:00:46.134 --> 00:00:48.252 line:91%
<c.yellow>But it's gonna be interesting.
We'll see how that goes.</c>

00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:50.333 line:91%
<c.yellow>We do have a backup plan...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay.</c>

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:51.984 line:91%
<c.yellow>...for if things don't work
with the dog.</c>

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:54.458 line:91%
I have a feeling they might not.
But we'll...

00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:56.563 line:91%
<c.yellow>So no matter what today,
we'll get these sheep in.</c>

00:00:56.563 --> 00:00:57.484 line:85%
Alright.

00:00:57.484 --> 00:00:59.896 position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>But it just might not be with the dog.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright. </c><c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:00:59.896 --> 00:01:03.086 line:91%
She's not gonna pay attention to
some city boy who's...

00:01:03.086 --> 00:01:05.489 line:91%
...who's been...
parachuted in here!

00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:08.412 position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>There's a good chance that is correct.</c>
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:01:08.412 --> 00:01:10.835 line:91%
<c.yellow>But we're about to find out.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright!</c>

00:01:10.835 --> 00:01:13.226 line:85%
<c.yellow>Away. Shh-shh!</c>

00:01:13.726 --> 00:01:15.709 line:85%
<c.yellow>Lie down, lie down.</c>

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.062 line:85%
<c.yellow>Away. Shh!</c>

00:01:19.064 --> 00:01:21.436 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(softly) </i></c><c.yellow>Lie down, lie down.</c>

00:01:21.436 --> 00:01:23.975 line:91%
You're speaking very quietly,
and she's still getting it.

00:01:24.764 --> 00:01:27.738 position:69% line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(to Meg) </i></c><c.yellow>Come by, come by.</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(to Tom) </i></c><c.yellow>It's a lot to do with tone as well.</c>

00:01:27.738 --> 00:01:29.655 line:85%
<c.yellow>So sometime— Lie down!</c>

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:32.727 line:91%
<c.yellow>If she's being a bit pushy,
you'll be a bit firmer.</c>

00:01:32.727 --> 00:01:35.738 line:91%
<c.yellow>Lie down, lie down.
How's your lie-downs?</c>

00:01:35.738 --> 00:01:36.766 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laughing)</i></c>

00:01:36.766 --> 00:01:39.191 position:56% line:91%
How bad is it gonna be if
I try and imitate a Scottish accent?

00:01:39.191 --> 00:01:42.518 position:61% line:91%
That's not gonna be—
<c.yellow>No, that'd... surely add to the humour.</c>

00:01:42.518 --> 00:01:45.125 line:91%
<c.yellow>Come by.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay, I hear three commands.</c>

00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:46.998 line:91%
<c.yellow>Mhm.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>"Lie down" is obvious.</c>

00:01:46.998 --> 00:01:49.259 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>"Come by" and "away"?</c>

00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:53.066 line:91%
<c.yellow>So "come by" is to go to the left,
and "away" is to go to the right.</c>

00:01:53.066 --> 00:01:55.085 line:85%
<c.yellow>Now, a lot of people will—</c>

00:01:55.085 --> 00:01:56.645 line:85%
The dog's right or your right?

00:01:56.645 --> 00:01:58.084 line:91%
<c.yellow>The dog's right.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay.</c>

00:01:59.307 --> 00:02:00.370 line:85%
<c.yellow>Come by.</c>

00:02:01.624 --> 00:02:04.221 line:85%
I—I'm amazed how she just...

00:02:04.221 --> 00:02:06.902 line:91%
...she can hear you
from such a long distance.

00:02:06.902 --> 00:02:10.284 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, I suppose that goes back to
dogs and their incredible hearing.</c>

00:02:10.284 --> 00:02:12.870 line:91%
<c.yellow>But she's almost...
waiting for the commands.</c>

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.997 line:85%
<c.yellow>So you know she's listening for it.</c>

00:02:14.997 --> 00:02:17.368 line:91%
<c.yellow>At the time, and yeah,
she's so responsive.</c>

00:02:17.368 --> 00:02:18.744 line:85%
<c.yellow>Even... you know...</c>

00:02:18.744 --> 00:02:22.148 position:66% line:91%
<c.yellow>Nine is getting quite old for a sheep dog.
She's losing a bit of speed.</c>

00:02:22.148 --> 00:02:24.599 line:91%
<c.yellow>But her hearing certainly seems
to still be working...</c>

00:02:24.599 --> 00:02:26.600 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laughing)</i></c>
<c.yellow>...to full effect, which is great.</c>

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.852 line:91%
<c.yellow>But she pushes her luck some days.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I saw that!</c>

00:02:29.852 --> 00:02:32.680 line:91%
<c.yellow>Although she's nine years old,
she's still like a teenager.</c>

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.509 position:63% line:91%
<c.yellow>She's like, "No, I don't wanna lie down,
I wanna keep chasing them!"</c>

00:02:35.509 --> 00:02:38.551 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay so, if
— which I believe is highly likely —</c>

00:02:38.551 --> 00:02:40.820 line:91%
<c.yellow>that Meg probably won't listen
to anything you say...</c>

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:43.374 line:91%
Yeah, okay. Alright.
<c.yellow>We have a backup plan.</c>

00:02:43.374 --> 00:02:46.470 line:91%
<c.yellow>I got you one of these.
Now this...</c>

00:02:46.996 --> 00:02:48.970 line:85%
<c.yellow>...is a sheep dog whistle.</c>

00:02:49.421 --> 00:02:52.373 line:91%
You got that engraved!
That's got my name on it!

00:02:52.373 --> 00:02:55.710 position:67% line:91%
<i>(laughs happily)</i>
<c.yellow>Now, that is a... that's a keepsake for you</c>

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.963 line:91%
Oh, thank you!
<c.yellow>to remember this whole experience.</c>

00:02:57.963 --> 00:03:00.680 line:91%
Oh, that's lovely.
<c.yellow>But a very popular thing with—</c>

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.834 position:56% line:91%
<c.yellow>Most shepherds will have one
around their neck, most of the time.</c>

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:05.025 line:85%
Yeah.

00:03:05.025 --> 00:03:07.031 line:91%
<c.yellow>The hard thing is,
it's a beautiful thing to look at.</c>

00:03:07.031 --> 00:03:10.742 line:91%
This is not like a sport whistle,
where you just blow and...?

00:03:10.742 --> 00:03:12.890 line:85%
<c.yellow>No, it's not like the dog whistle</c>

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:15.240 line:91%
<c.yellow>that many would know,
that's high-pitch frequency.</c>

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.601 line:85%
<c.yellow>There's a fair knack to it, so...</c>

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:21.140 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's gonna be fun watching you try—
Hey, you might surprise me.</c>

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:23.422 line:91%
<c.yellow>The idea is that your tongue
goes on the edge here.</c>

00:03:23.422 --> 00:03:26.503 line:91%
Okay. Yep.
<c.yellow>Of the whistle, and you just blow.</c>

00:03:27.646 --> 00:03:30.418 position:69% line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(in whistle code)</i> That'll do. Away. Come by.</c>

00:03:31.552 --> 00:03:33.224 line:85%
<i>(blows)</i>

00:03:33.224 --> 00:03:35.272 line:85%
I'm gonna be honest... <i>(coughs)</i>

00:03:35.272 --> 00:03:37.444 line:91%
<i>(blows wetly)</i>
<c.yellow><i>(wheezes)</i></c>

00:03:37.444 --> 00:03:40.355 position:70% line:91%
I'm gonna be honest,
I think we might wanna try the voice first(?)

00:03:40.355 --> 00:03:42.356 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(giggles)</i> Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>The voi-pff.</c>

00:03:42.356 --> 00:03:44.418 line:91%
<i>(rasps) <c.cyan>(whistles briefly)</c></i>
<c.yellow>I think we'll make this—</c>

00:03:44.418 --> 00:03:46.887 line:91%
<c.yellow>Oh—!</c>
<c.cyan><i>(whistles weakly)</i></c>

00:03:46.887 --> 00:03:48.931 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(whistling intensifies)</i></c>

00:03:48.931 --> 00:03:50.931 line:85%
<c.yellow>Ohh, he's a sheep farmer now!</c>

00:03:50.931 --> 00:03:52.584 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(whistles)</i></c>

00:03:52.584 --> 00:03:54.520 line:91%
There is a very confused dog
over there!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.460 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.924 line:91%
<c.yellow>I think, although we're
getting some good tones here...</c>

00:03:58.924 --> 00:04:01.041 line:91%
<c.yellow>We'll try the voice first?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>We'll go with the voice.</c>

00:04:01.041 --> 00:04:03.327 line:91%
<c.yellow>I would send her
to the right first, here.</c>

00:04:03.327 --> 00:04:05.462 position:56% line:91%
That's what I was thinking of doing,
so that's good(!)

00:04:05.462 --> 00:04:07.304 line:85%
That would be—

00:04:07.304 --> 00:04:10.000 line:91%
That would be...
say it quite loudly, "Away."

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.900 position:66% line:91%
"Away" is right, "come by" is left, right?
<c.yellow>Yep, yep.</c>

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.060 line:85%
So in theory...

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.650 line:85%
Away.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.635 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(wheezes)</i></c>
<i>(mouthing)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Nah.</c>

00:04:17.635 --> 00:04:19.897 line:91%
One word from me,
and she does absolutely nothing.

00:04:19.897 --> 00:04:22.532 line:91%
<c.yellow>Not even a flinch.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Not even— Didn't even flinch.</c>

00:04:22.532 --> 00:04:24.791 line:85%
Away! ...Yourself?

00:04:25.167 --> 00:04:26.363 line:85%
<c.yellow>Away.</c>

00:04:26.363 --> 00:04:28.596 line:85%
<c.yellow>Lie down, lie down.</c>

00:04:28.596 --> 00:04:30.598 line:85%
<c.yellow>That'll do Meg, lie down.</c>

00:04:30.598 --> 00:04:33.305 position:56% line:91%
I mean, what I'm gonna try and do...
<c.yellow>Do the accent?</c>

00:04:33.305 --> 00:04:35.801 position:58% line:91%
I know! I feel like I need permission
to do the accent.

00:04:35.801 --> 00:04:38.036 line:91%
<c.yellow>Just do it.
Be as Scottish as you can be.</c>

00:04:38.036 --> 00:04:39.273 line:85%
Away!

00:04:39.273 --> 00:04:40.701 line:91%
<c.yellow>Ooh.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh...?</c>

00:04:40.701 --> 00:04:42.575 line:91%
<c.yellow>There we go, that was—</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Away!</c>

00:04:42.575 --> 00:04:43.977 line:85%
Away!

00:04:43.977 --> 00:04:46.414 line:91%
No, she's just confused.
<c.yellow>Deepen it.</c>

00:04:46.414 --> 00:04:48.708 line:85%
<i>(deeper voice)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Away! Away.</c>

00:04:49.783 --> 00:04:52.010 line:91%
Away.
<c.yellow>And slower. "Ah-wee."</c>

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:54.357 line:91%
<c.yellow>Try to give it a wee bit.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Away!</c>

00:04:54.357 --> 00:04:57.238 line:91%
No. She knows it's not you!
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:04:57.238 --> 00:04:59.876 line:91%
Go for it, go for it.
<c.yellow>Away!</c>

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:02.508 position:61% line:91%
<c.yellow>But she knows, you're getting your own—</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>She knows the minute—</c>

00:05:02.508 --> 00:05:04.115 line:91%
<c.yellow>Do you know, that was
such a flashback too.</c>

00:05:04.115 --> 00:05:06.521 line:91%
<c.yellow>That's exactly what she was like
with me when I first started.</c>

00:05:07.021 --> 00:05:08.481 line:85%
Lie down.

00:05:08.481 --> 00:05:10.476 line:91%
<i>(softly)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Nothing.
Lie down!</c>

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.743 line:91%
<c.yellow>She got a wee flinch.
She knows the command, but she's...</c>

00:05:13.743 --> 00:05:14.871 line:85%
Lie down!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.252 line:91%
The /l/, she's got the /l/.
<c.yellow>Try it again.</c>

00:05:18.752 --> 00:05:20.745 line:91%
Lie down!
<c.yellow>Try it with the "Away."</c>

00:05:20.745 --> 00:05:21.954 line:85%
Away!

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:24.284 line:85%
<i>(softly)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> No! She hears the—</c>

00:05:24.284 --> 00:05:26.681 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(softly)</i> Go for a
right deep, long "Ah-weee".</c>

00:05:26.681 --> 00:05:28.372 line:85%
Away! No.

00:05:28.372 --> 00:05:30.482 line:91%
The voice is just wrong.
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i> Yes!</c>

00:05:30.482 --> 00:05:33.883 position:69% line:91%
<c.yellow>It's like the wee wire in her head says,
"That's a command, but oh, that wasn't him."</c>

00:05:33.883 --> 00:05:37.366 line:91%
No. That's not the... <i>(chuckles)</i>
Not the right person there.

00:05:37.366 --> 00:05:38.422 line:85%
<c.yellow>Away.</c>

00:05:38.935 --> 00:05:41.206 line:91%
She's so smart!
<c.yellow>Makes me feel so powerful now.</c>

00:05:41.206 --> 00:05:43.770 line:91%
She's so smart though!
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.775 line:91%
'Cause you can see the flinch,
and you can see

00:05:45.775 --> 00:05:48.001 line:91%
that she knows where to go,
the intonation—

00:05:48.001 --> 00:05:50.893 line:91%
Every little detail of the
command in your voice...

00:05:50.893 --> 00:05:52.760 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>...she's got, and she's following.</c>

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.923 position:59% line:91%
And... immediately,
over the hill, pulling the sheep back.

00:05:55.923 --> 00:05:58.232 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, it's a...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Incredible.</c>

00:05:58.232 --> 00:06:02.437 position:63% line:91%
<c.yellow>Real interesting to see her actually,
'cause I've not done that for six years.</c>

00:06:02.437 --> 00:06:05.364 position:59% line:91%
<c.yellow>So it's great to see how she reacted
there like this, and it's good to see—</c>

00:06:05.364 --> 00:06:08.424 line:91%
<c.yellow>Exactly as you say, she knows...
what she's meant to do,</c>

00:06:08.424 --> 00:06:10.620 line:91%
<c.yellow>but it's just not
any person saying it.</c>

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.307 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>You try and tell her to lie down now.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Lie down.</c>

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:15.090 line:85%
Lie down!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.086 line:91%
<c.yellow>Nice and firm.</c>
<i>(gruffly)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Lie down!</c>

00:06:18.534 --> 00:06:20.973 line:91%
Ohh!
<c.yellow>Ohh! <i>(laughs and claps)</i></c>

00:06:20.973 --> 00:06:23.079 line:85%
<c.yellow>That was good, try "come by".</c>

00:06:23.079 --> 00:06:24.248 line:85%
Come by!

00:06:24.248 --> 00:06:26.638 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(gasps)</i> We're away now.
We're away.</c>

00:06:27.415 --> 00:06:29.539 line:85%
Lie down! Lie down!

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:32.991 line:91%
Lie down! Nope.
<c.yellow><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:06:32.991 --> 00:06:34.970 line:91%
<c.yellow>Lie down, lie down.</c>
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.104 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both giggle)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It's so...</c>

00:06:37.104 --> 00:06:40.194 position:63% line:91%
<c.yellow>I was gonna go up, but there's
something there— There's potential here.</c>

00:06:40.194 --> 00:06:42.675 line:91%
<c.yellow>She might come home with you yet.</c>
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:06:43.275 --> 00:06:45.255 line:91%
<c.yellow>Try "away" again.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Away!</c>

00:06:45.255 --> 00:06:47.376 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>Oh...</i> 
</c><c.colorEEEEEE>There we go. It's...</c>

00:06:47.376 --> 00:06:49.481 line:91%
<c.yellow>She's getting the hang of it.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>She's getting it.</c>

00:06:50.239 --> 00:06:53.157 line:91%
<c.yellow>Try a "lie down" there.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Lie down! Lie down!</c>

00:06:53.157 --> 00:06:54.484 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(wheezes)</i></c>

00:06:54.484 --> 00:06:56.314 line:85%
Lie down! No...!

00:06:56.314 --> 00:06:59.221 line:91%
<c.yellow>Your Scottish is quite good though!
</c><c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laughing)</i></c>

00:06:59.221 --> 00:07:00.945 line:91%
<c.yellow>I just said you'd do that.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Lie down!</c>

00:07:01.559 --> 00:07:03.530 line:91%
Go ahead.
<c.yellow>Lie down. Lie down, Meg.</c>

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:06.001 line:91%
<c.yellow>Hey, lie down.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh, I'm confusing her now.</c>

00:07:06.001 --> 00:07:08.489 position:69% line:91%
<c.yellow>No, it's actually 'cause she standing there.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh, so she's calmed down.</c>

00:07:08.489 --> 00:07:10.445 position:66% line:85%
<c.yellow>Well, 'cause she's already standing still.</c>

00:07:10.445 --> 00:07:13.609 position:59% line:91%
She's like, "Well, what more can I do?
What difference will lying down make?"

00:07:13.609 --> 00:07:15.314 line:85%
So I'd send them left here?

00:07:15.314 --> 00:07:17.644 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, try it. Have a go.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>So that's "come by"?</c>

00:07:17.644 --> 00:07:19.978 line:85%
Come by! Come by.

00:07:20.484 --> 00:07:22.083 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(grunts)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Come by.</c>

